  "objectives": [
    "背得出並推得出 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-ax^2}\\,dx=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\pi}{a}}$（$a>0$）",
    "用配方處理一般的 Gaussian $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-ax^2+bx}\\,dx=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\pi}{a}}\\,e^{b^2/(4a)}$",
    "用對 $a$ 微分算動差 $\\int x^{2n}e^{-ax^2}\\,dx$，並用奇偶性直接看出奇數動差是 $0$"
  ],
  "visual": null,
  "concept": [
    {
      "heading": "① 從標準形開始",
      "body": [
        "偶函數，先折成右半邊，再令 $x=\\sqrt u$：",
        "換元先在 $[\\varepsilon,R]$ 上做再取極限；$\\Gamma(\\frac12)=\\sqrt\\pi$ 在 11.17 用極座標與夾擠嚴格證過",
        "縮放：$a>0$，令 $t=\\sqrt a\\,x$，$dx=\\dfrac{dt}{\\sqrt a}$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-x^2}\\,dx=\\sqrt\\pi",
        "2\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x^2}dx=\\int_0^\\infty u^{-1/2}e^{-u}\\,du=\\Gamma\\!\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)",
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-ax^2}\\,dx=\\frac1{\\sqrt a}\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-t^2}dt=\\sqrt{\\frac\\pi a}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 一次項：配方",
      "body": [
        "配方：$-x^2+2x=-(x-1)^2+1$",
        "平移嚴格來說：$\\int_{-R}^{R}$ 換成 $\\int_{-R-1}^{R-1}$，兩端仍然各自 $\\to\\mp\\infty$，極限不變",
        "一般情形（$a>0$，$b$ 任意）：",
        "驗算：$a=1,b=2$ 得 $\\sqrt\\pi\\,e^{4/4}=\\sqrt\\pi\\,e$",
        "一次項只做兩件事：搬中心、乘一個常數"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-x^2+2x}\\,dx",
        "=e\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-(x-1)^2}dx=e\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-t^2}dt=\\sqrt\\pi\\,e",
        "-ax^2+bx=-a\\Big(x-\\frac b{2a}\\Big)^2+\\frac{b^2}{4a}",
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-ax^2+bx}\\,dx=\\sqrt{\\frac\\pi a}\\;e^{b^2/(4a)}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 試一題",
      "body": [
        "再一個：$\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-2x^2+4x}\\,dx$",
        "$-2x^2+4x=-2(x-1)^2+2$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "=\\sqrt{\\frac\\pi2}\\;e^{2}\\approx9.261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 動差：對 $a$ 微分",
      "body": [
        "$\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial a}e^{-ax^2}=-x^2e^{-ax^2}$：對 $a$ 微分，就是乘上 $-x^2$",
        "為什麼可以微分進去：取 $a\\ge a_0>0$，",
        "控制函數可積：$x^{2n+2}e^{-a_0x^2}\\to0$，大 $|x|$ 時 $\\le\\dfrac1{x^2}$",
        "11.25 的瑕積分版 ⇒ 在 $a>a_0$ 上可以逐次微分；$a_0$ 任取 ⇒ 對所有 $a>0$ 成立",
        "微分 $n$ 次：",
        "$(-1)^n\\frac{d^n}{da^n}a^{-1/2}=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac32\\cdots\\frac{2n-1}2\\,a^{-1/2-n}$；負號剛好跟 $(-x^2)^n$ 的負號抵消"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "I(a)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-ax^2}dx=\\sqrt\\pi\\,a^{-1/2}\\quad(a>0)",
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}x^2e^{-ax^2}dx=-I'(a)=\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2\\,a^{-3/2}",
        "\\left|\\frac{\\partial^n}{\\partial a^n}e^{-ax^2}\\right|=x^{2n}e^{-ax^2}\\le x^{2n}e^{-a_0x^2}",
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}x^{2n}e^{-ax^2}dx=\\frac{1\\cdot3\\cdots(2n-1)}{2^n}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}{a^{n+1/2}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 奇數動差是 $0$",
      "body": [
        "$x^{2n+1}e^{-ax^2}$ 是奇函數，而且絕對收斂：",
        "先確認收斂才能說抵消",
        "反例：$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}x\\,dx$ 也是「奇函數」，但兩半各自發散，這個瑕積分不存在"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}x^{2n+1}e^{-ax^2}dx=0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 例：四次動差",
      "body": [
        "$x^4$ 要微分兩次：$\\displaystyle\\int x^4e^{-ax^2}dx=I''(a)$",
        "代 $a=3$：$3^{5/2}=9\\sqrt3$",
        "套公式（$n=2$）也一樣；數值驗算 $\\int_{-30}^{30}x^4e^{-3x^2}dx\\approx0.085277$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}x^4e^{-3x^2}\\,dx",
        "I''(a)=\\sqrt\\pi\\cdot\\Big(-\\tfrac12\\Big)\\Big(-\\tfrac32\\Big)a^{-5/2}=\\frac{3\\sqrt\\pi}4\\,a^{-5/2}",
        "\\begin{aligned}\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}x^4e^{-3x^2}dx&=\\frac{3\\sqrt\\pi}{4\\cdot9\\sqrt3}\\\\&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3\\pi}}{36}\\approx0.0853\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 常態分布的變異數",
      "body": [
        "證明：",
        "取 $a=\\frac12$：$a^{-3/2}=2^{3/2}=2\\sqrt2$",
        "除以 $\\sqrt{2\\pi}$，得 $1$　$\\blacksquare$",
        "另一條路：分部積分",
        "$u=x$，$dv=xe^{-x^2/2}dx$，$v=-e^{-x^2/2}$：",
        "邊界項 $=-2Re^{-R^2/2}\\to0$，剩下 $\\to\\sqrt{2\\pi}$",
        "同理，平均 $\\int xe^{-x^2/2}dx=0$（奇數動差）；總面積 $\\sqrt{\\pi/(1/2)}=\\sqrt{2\\pi}$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac1{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}x^2e^{-x^2/2}\\,dx=1",
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}x^2e^{-x^2/2}dx=\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2\\cdot2\\sqrt2=\\sqrt{2\\pi}",
        "\\int_{-R}^{R}x^2e^{-x^2/2}dx=\\Big[-xe^{-x^2/2}\\Big]_{-R}^{R}+\\int_{-R}^{R}e^{-x^2/2}dx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 跟 Gamma 的對照",
      "body": [
        "在 $(0,\\infty)$ 上令 $u=ax^2$，$x=\\sqrt{u/a}$：",
        "$2x^{2n}dx=2\\big(\\tfrac ua\\big)^n\\dfrac{du}{2\\sqrt{au}}=a^{-n-1/2}u^{n-1/2}du$",
        "Gamma 的遞迴：",
        "兩條路，同一個答案：",
        "• 對 $a$ 微分：每次掉下 $\\frac12,\\frac32,\\dots$",
        "• Gamma 遞迴：每次乘上 $\\frac12,\\frac32,\\dots$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}x^{2n}e^{-ax^2}dx=2\\int_0^\\infty x^{2n}e^{-ax^2}dx=\\frac{\\Gamma(n+\\frac12)}{a^{n+1/2}}",
        "\\Gamma\\!\\big(n+\\tfrac12\\big)=\\tfrac{2n-1}2\\cdots\\tfrac32\\cdot\\tfrac12\\,\\Gamma\\!\\big(\\tfrac12\\big)=\\frac{1\\cdot3\\cdots(2n-1)}{2^n}\\sqrt\\pi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "重點整理",
      "body": [
        "• $\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}e^{-ax^2}dx=\\sqrt{\\pi/a}$：從 $\\Gamma(\\frac12)$ 加縮放",
        "• 一次項：配方，$\\sqrt{\\pi/a}\\,e^{b^2/(4a)}$",
        "• 偶數動差：對 $a$ 微分（要有跟 $a$ 無關的控制函數）",
        "• 奇數動差：奇函數 ＋ 絕對收斂 ⇒ $0$",
        "• 同一件事：$\\dfrac{\\Gamma(n+\\frac12)}{a^{n+1/2}}$",
        "下一課：Dirichlet 積分 $\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\sin x}x\\,dx$"
      ]
    }
  ],
